    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Slime Research Base on Planet S has been invaded by an unknown creature that only Slime can damage. Slime must be used to survive until help arrives. The Slime of S also has a strong evolutionary capacity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt automatic fire;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast pace (22 minutes per battle session);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers hundreds of pet evolutions;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The formation system can have different bonuses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up bonus gems can upgrade abilities, increase and evolve pets;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the lucky dice to get random equipment or consumables;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refining systems can be strengthened;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 5 different game difficulty levels;</p></li></ul>",
